cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these simulations or figures, please cite the gallery as below."
title: "skasim gallery: SKA radio telescope simulation science cases"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "CSIC4SKA, Instituto de Astrofísica de Andalucía (IAA-CSIC)"
    website: "https://espsrc.github.io/skasim-gallery/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/espsrc/skasim-gallery"
url: "https://espsrc.github.io/skasim-gallery/"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end radio-interferometric simulations of the Square Kilometre Array
  (SKA) and its precursors made with skasim: multi-telescope continuum
  comparisons, circular polarization, the SKA-Mid staged delivery, redshifted
  starburst galaxies and HI kinematics.
keywords:
  - SKA
  - radio astronomy
  - radio interferometry
  - simulation
  - MeerKAT
  - OSKAR
  - WSClean
date-released: "2026-10-28"
